HAM10000 Demo Subset — License and Attribution
================================================

This directory contains a 20-image subset of the HAM10000 dataset, included
for demonstration purposes only.

Original dataset:
  Tschandl, P., Rosendahl, C. & Kittler, H. The HAM10000 dataset, a large
  collection of multi-source dermatoscopic images of common pigmented skin
  lesions. Sci. Data 5, 180161 (2018).
  https://doi.org/10.1038/sdata.2018.161

Source:
  Harvard Dataverse
  https://dataverse.harvard.edu/dataset.xhtml?persistentId=doi:10.7910/DVN/DBW86T

License:
  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

This subset (25 bkl + 25 mel images from the "vidir_modern" clinic partition)
is redistributed under the same CC BY-NC 4.0 license. For the full dataset,
please download from the Harvard Dataverse link above.
